  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Assessments in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to facilitate safe and healthy migration by ensuring United States Refugee Admissions Program (USRAP) beneficiaries residing in the Africa region meet immigration health requirements. As part of this work, IOM will conduct or arrange health assessments, vaccination, facilitate referrals where needed and plan for health assistance during travel, such as through the provision of medical escorts.</narrative>
  </description>
